 this is  unacceptable there's  i have this problem nobody solved it  so i'm gonna find a way to solve it for  myself  if you've done that chances are there  are other people who've had the same  problem and you can help them with it  so help them solve that problem  they'll be grateful they're looking for  an answer just like you would and you're  making it easy for them that's the  foundation of any successful business  and your third step to have a lot of  success is you got to match up  what you're passionate about what's  important  with what is offering  huge value to your customers  you match those two things up and you're  going to have a highly successful  business  you want to make a lot of money you want  to be really successful offer tons of  value to your customers you want to make  a lot of money quickly offer a lot of  value quickly to your customers  i want you to have success  and i know it's hard  it's hard not thinking about the dollars  you know it's hard when you're when  you're broke when you're trying to make  ends meet when you have kids and when  you're  you're struggling just to get by you  know you're thinking  i need money to pay the rent next week  you know like you gotta have cash i get  that  but if you want to have massive success  if that's your goal you want to make an  impact  you need to build a business around  something that you are intensely  passionate about and you'll make money  the money will come i promise you  if you just try to chase the next  money-making opportunity you're gonna  end up spending more time more dollars  more of the best years of your life  wasted on something  that is not going to work no matter what  people promise you  please don't make that mistake  and start a business around something  that you feel you can really have an  impact with  believe  thank you everybody for watching if you  like this video please give it a thumbs  up below it really makes me want to do  more for you and i'd love to hear 